ype="button" class="btn" data-size="xs">Enable</button>\n          </footer>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n  <article class="space-y-3">\n    <h3 class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground">Custom colors</h3>\n    <div class="flex min-h-40 flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 rounded-xl border p-6 sm:p-10">\n      <div class="w-full max-w-md">\n        <div class="alert border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 text-amber-900 dark:border-amber-900 dark:bg-amber-950 dark:text-amber-50"><i data-lucide="triangle-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i>\n          <h2>Your subscription will expire in 3 days.</h2>\n          <section>Renew now to avoid service interruption or upgrade to a paid plan to continue using the service.</section>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n  <article class="space-y-3">\n    <h3 class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground">RTL</h3>\n    <div class="flex min-h-40 flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 rounded-xl border p-6 sm:p-10">\n      <div class="w-full max-w-md">\n        <div class="grid items-start gap-4" dir="rtl">\n          <div class="alert"><i data-lucide="circle-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>\n            <h2>تم الدفع بنجاح</h2>\n            <section>تمت معالجة دفعتك البالغة 29.99 دولارًا. تم إرسال إيصال إلى عنوان بريدك الإلكتروني.</section>\n          </div>\n          <div class="alert"><i data-lucide="info" aria-hidden="true"></i>\n            <h2>ميزة جديدة متاحة</h2>\n            <section>لقد أضفنا دعم الوضع الداكن. يمكنك تفعيله في إعدادات حسابك.</section>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n</section>\n');
